                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Cat Burglar: A Tail of Purrsuit\n\nFrom what I understand, this was made for charity and developed very quickly, almost with a game jam mentality. Judged on those terms, it's really, really good.\n\nIt's easy to see the passion behind it, and considering the scope and circumstances of its development, the end result is genuinely impressive. Is it a massive AAA production? Of course not. But that's not the point. For what it's trying to be, it succeeds admirably.\n\nMost importantly, it's all in support of a good cause.\n\nThumbs up from me. A fun little game, built with heart, and for charity too. Hard not to recommend that.",
